<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi's Arabian Cement H1 97 pre-tax profit falls.</title>
<headline>Saudi's Arabian Cement H1 97 pre-tax profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			  (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	    81.4    vs    89.2</p>
<p> Sales income		84.7    vs    83.6</p>
<p> Net sales income	  69.7    vs    75.6</p>
<p> Other income		11.7    vs    13.6</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity   965.5    vs   910.6</p>
<p> Assets		   1,445.2    vs 1,445.3</p>
<p>Full Name: Arabian Cement Company Limited.</p>
<p>Note - The firm, traded in the Saudi market, is one of eight cement companies operating in the kingdom. -- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424.</p>
</text>
